<title>BELGIUM: Dutch move said cautious.</title>
<headline>Dutch move said cautious.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nobody could ever accuse the European Union of failing to take the bull by the horns when it comes to sensitive issues.</p>
<p>The title of the Dutch EU presidency's latest report on the inter-governmental conference is: &quot;Addendum to the Dublin II General Outline for a Draft Revision of the Treaties.&quot;</p>
<p>One diplomat called the move &quot;cautious&quot;.</p>
</text>
